OL,3,GNEWSAWhite Horse setting could be
OL,4,A'harmed' by new homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build 41 homes in fields below
OL,7,Fan "iconic" white horse hill monument
OL,8,Fhave drawn widespread objections, some
OL,9,Fclaiming it will harm the setting of
OL,10,Fthe landmark.
OL,12,FThe outline proposal, submitted by
OL,13,FManor and Auckland Farm, is for a
OL,14,Fdevelopment on land in the shadow of
OL,15,Fthe Westbury White Horse in Wiltshire.
OL,17,FFirst filed in 2022, the application
OL,18,Fhas attracted fresh opposition from the
OL,19,Flocal town council and residents
OL,20,Fconcerned it will impact "views of and
OL,21,Ffrom the White Horse".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
